    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d50">

                <pb facs="0110" n="696" sameAs="frus:frus1949v07p2/pg696"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00116 PW/4–149</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by the Chief of the Division of Northeast
                        Asian Affairs</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Bishop</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the State–Army–Navy–Air Force Coordinating Committee
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1949-04-01">April 1, 1949</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Memorandum for the Secretary</hi>, SANACC
                </p>
                <p rendition="#flush">Subject: FEC Recommendation on
                    Trial of Japanese War Criminals</p>
                <p>There is enclosed a copy of a recommendation regarding the trial of Japanese War
                    Criminals which was approved at the 147th meeting of the Far Eastern Commission
                    on March 31, 1949, by a vote of six in favor (Australia, France, India, New
                    Zealand, U.K. and U.S.), 1 against (Philippines) and 4 abstentions (Canada,
                    China, Netherlands and USSR).</p>
                <pb facs="0111" n="697" xml:id="pg697"/>
                <p>It is requested that the text of the attached recommendation be forwarded to the
                    Joint Chiefs of Staff for transmission to General MacArthur for his
                    information.</p>
                <p>The Secretary General of the Far Eastern Commission has been requested by the
                    U.S. Government to delay release of this recommendation to the press until this
                    cable has been dispatched.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d50-f1"/>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Max W. Bishop</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d50-f1" n="1" xml:id="d50-f1-content">
                <p>For recommendation released April 1, see Department of State <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Bulletin</hi>, May 1, 1949, p. 569. For report of FEC meeting on March 31, see <hi
                        rendition="#italic">ibid</hi>., p. 570.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
